# PROJECT: GIFTLY
## A Modern Multi-Category E-Commerce Platform with Smart Gift Discovery

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, UI/UX designer, database architect and e-commerce product developer.

I want you to build a complete, functional, professional, responsive, modern e-commerce website called GIFTLY.

This is not a simple frontend demonstration or static website. Build a complete full-stack e-commerce application with a working frontend, backend, database, authentication, product catalogue, shopping cart, checkout, order management and a unique product recommendation feature.

Develop the project with clean architecture, reusable components, secure data handling and maintainable code.

Do not create only a visual prototype. All important buttons, forms, navigation links and shopping functionalities must work.

==================================================
1. PROJECT IDENTITY
==================================================

Brand Name: GIFTLY

Main Tagline:
"Everyday Shopping. Extraordinary Discoveries."

Special Feature:
"GiftMatch – Find a gift they'll actually love."

Project Type:
Multi-category e-commerce shopping platform.

Core Business Concept:

GIFTLY must function as a general-purpose online shopping website similar in concept to conventional e-commerce marketplaces.

It must NOT look like a website dedicated exclusively to gifting.

Customers should be able to purchase products for their everyday needs across multiple categories.

However, GIFTLY should have one distinctive feature called GiftMatch.

GiftMatch helps customers discover suitable products when purchasing something for another person.

The website must support two main shopping journeys:

1. Normal Shopping:
Browse → Search → Product Details → Cart → Checkout → Order.

2. GiftMatch Shopping:
Recipient → Occasion → Interests → Budget → Recommendations → Product → Cart → Checkout.

IMPORTANT:

GiftMatch is the speciality of GIFTLY, not its entire business.

The regular shopping experience must remain the primary focus of the website.

